unreal/Peripheral/Build/
unreal/Peripheral/DerivedDataCache/
unreal/Peripheral/Intermediate/
unreal/Peripheral/Saved/
unreal/Peripheral/.vs/
unreal/Peripheral/*.sln
unreal/Peripheral/*.suo
unreal/Peripheral/*.opensdf
unreal/Peripheral/*.sdf
unreal/Peripheral/*.VC.db
unreal/Peripheral/*.VC.opendb
unreal/Peripheral/Plugins/**/Binaries/
unreal/Peripheral/Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# MCP client config — machine-specific, regenerate per machine with:
